      "benchmark": "dslash",
      "title": "A sampled kernel can belong to excluded setup",
      "observation": "Both source paths compute backward links before starting the Dslash timer. Those source call sites are excluded, while the hopping callback is included. A profile can nevertheless sample make_back/back_kernel during warmup/setup. Source-family inclusion therefore cannot establish actual sampled phase or justify joining all sampled counters with the reported primary mean.",
